1
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:17,500
Those who ceaselessly hone the art
of killing are known as masters.

2
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,157
These lethal abilities, dutifully
passed down through many generations,

3
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:25,200
have become what are
called modified bloodlines.

4
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:28,857
This is the story of one such master,

5
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:32,720
Hikaru Gero of the Poison Clan
and his greatest challenge yet,

6
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:34,180
to get married.

7
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:57,260
No mama, lots of time.

8
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:04,300
Fun, fun, fun, you so
cool, no, blah, blah?

9
00:01:45,740 --> 00:01:46,570
kill or kiss.

10
00:01:47,566 --> 00:01:48,396
toxic.

11
00:01:49,392 --> 00:01:50,222
toxic.

12
00:01:53,957 --> 00:01:54,787
Let's go!

13
00:01:54,870 --> 00:01:55,700
Kill our kids!

14
00:01:55,783 --> 00:01:56,613
Kill, kill our kids!

15
00:01:56,696 --> 00:01:57,526
Kill our kids!

16
00:01:57,609 --> 00:01:58,439
Kill, kill our kids!

17
00:01:58,522 --> 00:01:59,520
Kill our kids!

18
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:01,280
Kill, kill our kids!

19
00:02:06,340 --> 00:02:07,360
All right!

20
00:02:07,660 --> 00:02:08,677
Hope you're ready!

21
00:02:08,760 --> 00:02:11,137
Time for the test of
courage, but where to?

22
00:02:11,220 --> 00:02:12,050
