so no one gets separated.

28
00:02:25,180 --> 00:02:26,533
Don't forget the flash.

29
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:28,800
Onward, you brave souls!

30
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:31,597
Let's all make memories
we'll treasure forever!

31
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:32,510
Yeah!

32
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:47,400
Gato, this'll be your big chance.

33
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:50,817
Surely even you've heard of
the suspension bridge effect.

34
00:02:50,900 --> 00:02:54,777
When you cross one, you mistake your heart
racing for liking whoever you're with.

35
00:02:54,860 --> 00:02:56,331
It's the same for ghosts.

36
00:02:56,780 --> 00:02:57,610
Okay.

37
00:02:57,880 --> 00:02:59,840
Remember, mood is key. Got that?

38
