you're going to end up
single the rest of your life!

40
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:07,837
Why does Kinosaki seem so into this?

41
00:03:07,920 --> 00:03:10,508
I asked for help getting
married, but still.

42
00:03:12,460 --> 00:03:13,290
You!

43
00:03:17,340 --> 00:03:21,600
I wanted to say thank you for
sticking with me and stuff.

44
00:03:22,220 --> 00:03:25,161
You don't have to pretend
this isn't a total pain.

45
00:03:25,860 --> 00:03:30,360
I know it would have made your job a
lot easier if instead of coming here,

46
00:03:30,660 --> 00:03:31,920
I just stayed home.

47
00:03:32,220 --> 00:03:33,749
It wouldn't have mattered.

48
00:03:34,860 --> 00:03:38,860
There's only so many options in the
woods for your attacker to take.

49
00:03:39,500 --> 00:03:41,853
But if you really want to do me a favor,

50
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:47,984
it would be for the best if you could
forget your worries and just enjoy the trip.

51
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:54,809
You get a limited number of
opportunities like this in life.

52
00:03:55,220 --> 00:03:59,338
There's no need to waste this one
just because someone wants you dead.

53
