80
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:20,631
Attempting something beyond your limits
will only lead to one thing, Shiori.

81
00:07:20,980 --> 00:07:21,810
Suffering.

82
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:35,360
The truth is you're never going to
be strong accept it and just let go.

83
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:41,237
I know you have expectations to live up to

84
00:07:41,320 --> 00:07:46,280
mine and everyone else's
must be hard on you!

85
00:07:52,020 --> 00:07:53,860
I just want to let go.

86
00:07:54,500 --> 00:07:56,020
and not worry.

87
00:08:02,840 --> 00:08:03,680
You're right.

88
00:08:04,400 --> 00:08:05,900
It is exhausting.

89
00:08:07,180 --> 00:08:08,460
But who cares?

90
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:10,760
Because it's all worth it!

91
00:08:11,060 --> 00:08:14,080
I felt so alive when they
enjoyed my magic show!

92
00:08:16,280 --> 00:08:18,160
Maybe I'll never be strong.

93
00:08:18,380 --> 00:08:22,057
No matter how hard I push
myself, and even if I'm not?

94
00:08:22,140 --> 00:08:24,800
I won't take the easy way out!

95
00:08:25,200 --> 00:08:26,980
I'm done being afraid!

96
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:32,380
That's a long way down!

97
00:08:32,620 --> 00:08:33,680
I'm going to die!

98
00:08:33,900 --> 00:08:34,900
What should I do?

99
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:35,997
What's happening?

100
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:37,157
The rubber's too shallow!

101
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,097
Broke my pants!

102
00:08:38,180 --> 00:08:39,010
Friends!

103
00:08:39,093 --> 00:08:39,923
Umbrella?

104
00:08:40,620 --> 00:08:42,200
Do your thing, umbrella!

105
00:08:44,660 --> 00:08:49,013
If I die like this, I'll be letting
down everyone who's ever protected me!

106
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:51,460
I've got to do something!

107
00:08:52,140 --> 00:08:52,970
But what?

108
00:09:03,280 --> 00:09:04,320
I'm alive!

109
00:09:04,540 --> 00:09:05,640
It's a miracle!

110
00:09:06,220 --> 00:09:08,120
It's water-absorbent polymers!

111
00:09:11,420 --> 00:09:14,637
They needed to make it look
like a suicide or accident.

112
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:15,550
Otherwise,

113
00:09:15,633 --> 00:09:17,597
your relatives would be
suspects and could end

114
