up losing a lot more
than their inheritance.

115
00:09:20,900 --> 00:09:24,020
Everything down to the last
detail was planned out.

116
00:09:25,500 --> 00:09:29,540
Even the legend of Lord
Cladney, all of it made up.

117
00:09:32,560 --> 00:09:34,300
Right, Soundmaster Naruko?

118
00:09:39,280 --> 00:09:40,940
That was a clever trick.

119
00:09:41,420 --> 00:09:44,302
The moment she took that
picture at the photo op.

120
00:09:45,060 --> 00:09:45,890
Mr.

121
00:09:45,973 --> 00:09:47,220
Gale, where'd you go?

122
00:09:47,820 --> 00:09:48,717
While I was distracted,

123
00:09:48,800 --> 00:09:52,565
