scrambled my sense of direction.

124
00:09:52,760 --> 00:09:54,777
Separating me from Muresh, you know.

125
00:09:54,860 --> 00:09:57,566
You're a lot feistier
than I thought you'd be.

126
00:09:58,240 --> 00:10:00,480
I will super enjoy this.

127
00:10:02,020 --> 00:10:02,850
Relax!

128
