Like you said, suicide or accident,
I only dance the way they pay me to.

129
00:10:11,820 --> 00:10:12,720
We're leaving.

130
00:10:12,980 --> 00:10:14,537
It's too risky staying here.

131
00:10:14,620 --> 00:10:15,450
On your feet.

132
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:18,080
I can't stand.

133
00:10:19,140 --> 00:10:20,660
My knees gave up.

134
00:10:21,580 --> 00:10:25,800
Well, if you can't run,
better hop on my back.

135
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:28,609
Thanks for preparing
me for this, Kinosaki.

136
00:10:28,700 --> 00:10:30,260
I showed him the ropes.

137
00:10:37,280 --> 00:10:39,221
Not what I had in mind, but sure.

138
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:41,700
We'll make it work.

139
00:10:42,060 --> 00:10:44,740
Whatever you do, don't
let go of me. Right.

140
00:10:49,880 --> 00:10:52,700
Modified Bloodline Plus Plus.

141
00:10:53,100 --> 00:10:54,680
Mind Whisper.

142
00:10:56,500 --> 00:10:58,120
What's going on?

143
00:10:58,340 --> 00:11:01,840
If I had to guess, he's
messing with our minds.

144
00:11:10,340 --> 00:11:12,357
