145
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:17,020
So this is the secret modified
bloodline of the Poison Masters.

146
00:11:18,560 --> 00:11:22,040
Experiencing your toxic
vibes is a super rare treat.

147
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,480
