165
00:12:33,940 --> 00:12:35,116
I should have known.

166
00:12:35,340 --> 00:12:37,357
Those attacks weren't meant for me.

167
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:39,911
He hid her headphones with the vibrations.

168
00:12:44,040 --> 00:12:45,620
Just as I expected.

169
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:47,591
It's not only her father.

170
00:12:47,920 --> 00:12:51,200
This girl, she's a
treasure trove of trauma.

171
00:12:51,580 --> 00:12:53,920
There's so much material to work with,

172
00:12:54,040 --> 00:12:57,460
