plan to wipe you out. Sad.

182
00:13:32,480 --> 00:13:34,420
There's no one on your side.

183
00:13:37,320 --> 00:13:39,379
That's nothing but a bunch of bull!

184
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:46,300
Before he chose me,

185
00:13:46,560 --> 00:13:50,678
your uncle interviewed a ton of
bodyguards looking for a professional.

186
00:13:51,340 --> 00:13:55,281
But he kept hiring scumbags who
had zero clue what they were doing.

187
00:13:55,880 --> 00:14:00,056
He wound up shelling out a fortune
for every contract he had to cancel.

188
00:14:01,580 --> 00:14:06,286
The only reason he reached out to me was
because of a Kray's 10,000-word review.

189
00:14:06,900 --> 00:14:09,480
He trusted you'd be safe in my hands.

190
00:14:10,680 --> 00:14:14,915
Would he have gone through all this
trouble if he didn't care about you?

191
00:14:18,040 --> 00:14:18,870
Yurei!

192
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:24,680
