195
00:14:29,700 --> 00:14:33,171
Obviously he would be able to
navigate around my illusions.

196
00:14:33,560 --> 00:14:35,380
You can hear me, can't you?

197
00:14:36,460 --> 00:14:39,597
I know your illusions and
brainwashing tricks drag out traumatic

198
00:14:39,680 --> 00:14:43,621
