subconscious and amplify them.

199
00:14:44,700 --> 00:14:46,994
Yes, she has a messy situation at home.

200
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:50,673
And yes, her uncle did give
her permission to go camping.

201
00:14:51,440 --> 00:14:54,440
But that's only a small
part of the bigger picture.

202
00:14:55,680 --> 00:15:00,386
He was tempted for a second to let her
go, and you amped up his urge to give in.

203
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:04,656
Ureshino knows she has weaknesses,
but she's fighting to overcome them.

204
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:08,240
So back off.

205
00:15:09,800 --> 00:15:12,388
She doesn't need you
giving her a hard time.

206
00:15:22,700 --> 00:15:25,917
Hmm well that's really
strange according to

207
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:28,647
my phone the two of them
should be right here

208
00:15:30,460 --> 00:15:34,240
There you are wait a minute what the heck

209
00:15:36,500 --> 00:15:40,800
So that's why you were running late
i'm glad i put a gps tracker on her

210
00:15:41,820 --> 00:15:47,500
Courtesy of me kitami got a little work
related injury i pushed myself a bit

211
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:49,240
You're tracking me?

212
00:15:49,640 --> 00:15:51,228
I need your help, Kinosaki.

213
00:15:51,500 --> 00:15:54,147
Take Ureshino and get
away from this village.

214
00:15:54,340 --> 00:15:55,800
Mm-hmm. I... what?

215
00:15:56,240 --> 00:16:00,700
In order to complete his mission,
he'll need to eliminate me first.

216
00:16:01,980 --> 00:16:04,392
I've already spoiled his plans twice now.

217
00:16:04,700 --> 00:16:06,582
I have to take him out for good.

218
00:16:07,660 --> 00:16:11,640
The thing is, while I'm tied
up, I need you to keep her safe.

219
00:16:12,300 --> 00:16:15,712
Yeah, as your marriage advisor,
that's outside my purview.

220
00:16:18,060 --> 00:16:19,980
I can make an exception, though.

221
00:16:22,460 --> 00:16:23,580
So selfless.

222
00:16:24,020 --> 00:16:25,020
Okay, let's go.

223
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:29,188
Let me see your headphones.

224
00:16:30,720 --> 00:16:31,860
Just as I thought.

225
00:16:32,960 --> 00:16:35,680
He took a big risk
getting that close to her.

226
00:16:36,100 --> 00:16:39,512
He planted this to enhance his
illusions and brainwashing.

227
00:16:40,660 --> 00:16:44,484
As far as his abilities go, I
don't know the full extent of them.

228
00:16:45,500 --> 00:16:46,700
This will be fun.

229
00:16:47,500 --> 00:16:51,265
If you're not going to fight me
face to face, I'll drag you out.

230
00:16:52,860 --> 00:16:54,340
I'm fine right here.

231
00:16:54,900 --> 00:16:59,300
If I go after the target, I might
end up with a syringe in my back.

232
00:17:01,880 --> 00:17:03,420
Super bad news.

233
00:17:03,780 --> 00:17:05,917
I need to get that Poison Master out of my

234
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:08,529
hair that I can take
my time with Ureshino.

235
00:17:09,040 --> 00:17:10,960
That's how this tune goes.

236
00:17:11,360 --> 00:17:13,880
And I've never felt readier to play.

237
00:17:14,860 --> 00:17:16,360
It's time to perform.

238
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:18,070
The finale.

239
00:17:22,860 --> 00:17:24,980
He just got a lot more serious.

240
00:17:25,900 --> 00:17:28,488
Toxic gases dissipate
in the great outdoors.

241
00:17:28,820 --> 00:17:33,702
As for poison needles, they're essentially
useless unless you're able to locate me.

242
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:35,840
So what's your next move?

243
00:17:36,200 --> 00:17:38,237
Let's see you use those tricks of yours.

244
00:17:38,320 --> 00:17:40,020
Once I dissolve your wires!

245
00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:42,540
It bounced off?

246
00:17:43,540 --> 00:17:46,480
My strings vibrate at super high speeds.

247
00:17:46,780 --> 00:17:49,320
