No, I would have sensed it if he did.

256
00:19:10,920 --> 00:19:13,391
You didn't wither them with poison either.

257
00:19:14,560 --> 00:19:16,913
Actually, they look healthier than ever.

258
00:19:17,960 --> 00:19:19,700
Wait, don't tell me.

259
00:19:23,540 --> 00:19:24,952
Nice friends you've got.

260
00:19:25,300 --> 00:19:27,080
They seem to like my medicine.

261
00:19:28,180 --> 00:19:29,945
Your technique's hard to tune.

262
00:19:30,340 --> 00:19:31,869
That's its one weak point.

263
00:19:32,320 --> 00:19:36,000
If the trees continue growing,
you can't play precise notes.

264
00:19:39,160 --> 00:19:40,100
Show's over.

265
00:19:44,840 --> 00:19:49,200
Fear is buried deep down inside
a person's psyche, waiting.

266
00:19:50,720 --> 00:19:52,780
I've already sown the seeds.

267
00:19:54,680 --> 00:19:58,980
All that's left for me to
do is to allow them to grow.

268
00:20:01,960 --> 00:20:03,372
Where have you two been?

269
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:05,188
We've got a huge emergency.

270
00:20:06,280 --> 00:20:07,200
Rock slide?

271
00:20:07,540 --> 00:20:09,658
But that's the only way out of here.

272
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:12,817
Someone started feeling sick
during the Test of Courage.

273
00:20:12,900 --> 00:20:16,057
We tried driving them to
the hospital, but, well...

274
00:20:16,140 --> 00:20:18,657
These mountains are too
dangerous for amateurs.

275
00:20:18,740 --> 00:20:19,757
Let's wait for rescue.

276
00:20:19,840 --> 00:20:21,134
Wait, look over there!

277
00:20:30,880 --> 00:20:32,520
Let's hear that fear.

278
00:20:33,740 --> 00:20:35,640
It's the wrath of Lord Clotney!

279
00:20:41,960 --> 00:20:43,620
I don't want to die!

280
00:20:44,840 --> 00:20:47,160
A sacrifice must be made!

281
00:20:48,280 --> 00:20:50,240
We need to follow the legend.

282
00:20:50,900 --> 00:20:54,600
To appease Lord Glotney,
we must offer up a child.

283
00:20:55,500 --> 00:20:58,740
We must determine who here
among us is the youngest.

284
00:20:59,200 --> 00:21:03,259
Whoever has the latest birthday will
be sacrificed to halt his wrath.

285
00:21:03,500 --> 00:21:07,037
New students, take out
your IDs so we can check.

286
00:21:07,120 --> 00:21:09,120
September 27th.

287
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:11,397
February 4th.

288
00:21:11,480 --> 00:21:12,897
October 10th.

289
00:21:12,980 --> 00:21:14,040
May 5th.

290
00:21:14,220 --> 00:21:15,600
March 20th.

291
00:21:16,900 --> 00:21:21,120
I was born in March on the 31st.

292
00:21:22,040 --> 00:21:26,334
At this point, if you think you can
stop the seeds of panic from growing,

293
00:21:26,420 --> 00:21:27,500
you're dead wrong.

294
00:21:28,320 --> 00:21:29,150
Grab her!

295
00:21:29,940 --> 00:21:31,460
She's getting away!

296
00:21:34,300 --> 00:21:37,540
It's only a matter of time
until the target dies.

297
00:21:38,820 --> 00:21:40,920
They'll never stop pursuing her.

298
00:21:41,300 --> 00:21:43,760
That is, unless you're able to defeat me.

299
00:22:01,700 --> 00:22:03,180
Super complete.

300
00:22:05,600 --> 00:22:07,000
A violin?

301
00:22:07,580 --> 00:22:09,160
He's gonna hit me!

302
00:22:11,280 --> 00:22:14,620
With the Soundmaster's
modified bloodline increments!

303
00:22:33,460 --> 00:22:34,290
Ah!

304
00:23:52,320 --> 00:23:55,440
Next time, together with me.
